OL,3,ABomb hoaxes across Europe disrupt
OL,4,Aflights as two UK airports also receive
OL,5,Athreats
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 21 flights across Europe have
OL,8,Fbeen impacted by bomb threats after at
OL,9,Fleast seven flights were affected by
OL,10,Fsimilar threats on Tuesday
OL,12,FBoth London Heathrow and Birmingham
OL,13,FAirports say they received threats
OL,14,Fearlier on Thursday, with Heathrow
OL,15,Fsaying its was "deemed not credible"
OL,17,FAirport authorities in Rome say they
OL,18,Freceived a threat on email from a group
OL,19,Fcalled "Fighters of the Male State"
OL,20,Fclaiming to be targeting a "feminist
OL,21,Fregime"
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
