OL,3,ABomb hoaxes across Europe disrupt
OL,4,Aflights as two UK airports also receive
OL,5,Athreats
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Aer Lingus flight from Dublin to
OL,8,FRome was diverted to a French military
OL,9,Fair base, one passenger tells the BBC
OL,10,F"we were all trying to be as calm as we
OL,11,Fcould"
OL,13,FIn Prague, Czech police say no
OL,14,Fexplosives were found aboard four
OL,15,Fflights, following threats about an
OL,16,F"improvised explosive device"
OL,18,FAn aircraft was escorted into Rome
OL,19,FFiumicino Airport by Italian Air Force
OL,20,Fjets, while the Bulgarian military says
OL,21,Fits jets escorted three aircraft to
OL,22,FSofia
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
